# 二进制文件:禁止行尾转换(CRLF<->LF 转换会破坏 png/ico/exe 等文件,
# 曾导致 public/icon.ico 少一个字节、NSIS 打包报 unable to read icon)
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary

# shell 脚本必须保持 LF:容器里 /bin/sh 执行带 CRLF 的脚本会直接
# "exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory"(实测 v1.18.3 构建踩过)。
# 这条同时管住 git checkout(core.autocrlf=true 的 Windows 工作区)。
*.sh text eol=lf
